1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,898
AI;DR,

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:05,137
version 0.1.16.

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,060
Every 30 minutes,

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,569
AI;DR reads its sources

5
00:00:08,569 --> 00:00:10,726
and skips any that keep failing.

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,024
Vietnamese text is checked

7
00:00:13,024 --> 00:00:15,254
for syllables no Vietnamese word uses.

8
00:00:15,254 --> 00:00:16,900
Older stories too.

9
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:20,685
Day card headlines never go below 23 px.

10
00:00:20,685 --> 00:00:22,783
Crowded tiles become rows.

11
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:24,990
Before any email goes out,

12
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,255
it is claimed first.

13
00:00:26,255 --> 00:00:27,439
If two runs overlap,

14
00:00:27,439 --> 00:00:29,062
only one sends.

15
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:33,312
Follow AI;DR by RSS in Feedly,

16
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:35,900
Inoreader or NewsBlur.

17
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,106
And on four and five story days,

18
00:00:38,106 --> 00:00:40,251
Telegram lists every story.

19
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,504
Release notes at aidr.today.
